Package: dewlock
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: screen locker for Wayland compositors
 dewlock is a customizable screen locker for Wayland, focused on
 providing a beautiful user experience with sensible defaults.
 .
 It works with any compositor implementing the ext-session-lock-v1
 protocol, including sway, Hyprland, river and niri.
 .
 Authentication goes through PAM, using /etc/pam.d/dewlock, and honors
 the system's existing authentication policy.
 .
 dewlock can detach from the terminal and report readiness over a file
 descriptor, so it can integrate with idle managers such as swayidle.
